  "definition": "Comparable",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-07-19",
  "historyNote": "#7152, eff 12-10-99 (formerly Tax 101.10); ss by #8985, eff 9-24-07 (from Tax 102.10); ss by #10623, eff 6-26-14 (from Tax 102.11); ss by 13686, eff 7-19-23",
